# Backend (Go)

- REST `/api/v1`; separate handlers, business logic, storage.
- Do not compute metrics in HTTP handlers.
- Isolate Trello in client/importer/sync; timeouts mandatory.
- Schema only via migrations; UTC timestamps; immutable raw events; idempotent import.
- Secrets in env only; enforce authz on server; no secrets in logs/responses.
- Unit tests for metrics/history; integration for sync/API.
- Details SSOT: trello_analytics_open_spec `.cursor/rules/backend.mdc` and AGENTS.md.
